# Personal data never enters the repository.
data/
*.json.broken
*.json.tmp
ledger-backup-*.json
pre-import-*.json

# Reference material is local only — it vendors a whole repo and a venv.
# Three things are the exception, and all three for the same reason: they
# have to survive a fresh clone or something in the repository stops being
# checkable.
#
#   legacy-profiles/   the retired rulesets, input to authoring the real
#                      strategies
#   the profile doc    what the first consultation said, and the record of
#                      what the two authored strategies were corrected from
#   the addendum       the review that corrected it. Twelve declared values
#                      across the two shipped strategies name it as their
#                      source, and a source nobody can open is not one
dev_reference_docs/*
!dev_reference_docs/legacy-profiles/
!dev_reference_docs/ledger-default-profiles.md
!dev_reference_docs/ledger-default-profiles-addendum.md

# Agent context — local only.
claude.md
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
build/
dist/
*.spec
.venv/
venv/

.DS_Store
